{"id": "EUVD-2026-96888", "enisaUuid": "e0b19011-fb95-3048-add1-adb8cdae5e04", "description": "open-computer-use through commit 610bac8 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability in Logger.write_log_file in os_computer_use/logging.py, which writes transcript text into log.html without HTML escaping. Attackers controlling sandbox content, such as web pages or files appearing in run_command output, can inject script that runs when operators open the log, exfiltrating transcript contents.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T19:49:14", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind03/e2b-open-computer-use-html-log-injection", "https://github.com/e2b-dev/open-computer-use/blob/610bac85d242b2fdf43fbe36bce2348658a2d4c9/os_computer_use/logging.py#L60-L82", "https://github.com/e2b-dev/open-computer-use/blob/610bac85d242b2fdf43fbe36bce2348658a2d4c9/os_computer_use/sandbox_agent.py#L25-L35", "https://github.com/e2b-dev/open-computer-use", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/open-computer-use-through-commit-610bac8-stored-xss-via-log-html-session-log"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108722", "GHSA-jr77-j87x-vf2g"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c7ca30b5-2a0d-3253-a196-6e83a6e8afab", "product": {"name": "open-computer-use", "vendor": {"name": "e2b-dev"}}, "product_version": "0 \u2264610bac85d242b2fdf43fbe36bce2348658a2d4c9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a3834097-7404-30b5-b992-f48986648a60", "vendor": {"name": "e2b-dev"}}], "isExploited": false}